    <fr:title text="global element">global element</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>
    A <html:em>global element</html:em> of an object <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A ∈ \mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> is <html:em>just</html:em> a
    morphism <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[e : 1 → A]]></fr:tex>.
</html:p>
    <html:p>
    From <fr:link href="/mclarty-1992/" title="Elementary Categories, Elementary Toposes" uri="https://hejohns.github.io/mclarty-1992/" display-uri="mclarty-1992" type="local">Elementary Categories, Elementary Toposes</fr:link>. Compare with <fr:link href="/hejohns-000L/" title="generalized element" uri="https://hejohns.github.io/hejohns-000L/" display-uri="hejohns-000L" type="local">generalized element</fr:link>.
</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
